  "instructions": [
    "heat 1 tablespoon vegetable oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "add 2 cloves minced garlic and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "add 1 piece sliced ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "add 1 lb boneless chicken breast and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "add 4 cups fish broth, 2 cups water, 2 tablespoons fish sauce, and 2 tablespoons lemon juice.",
    "bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "add 1 cup brine wet comte cheese and stir until melted and well combined.",
    "add 1 can coconut milk and stir until heated through.",
    "season with black pepper to taste.",
    "serve hot on a hot stone plate, garnished with green onions, chopped fresh ginger, and papaya leaves, if desired."
  ],
